      "slug": "relayx",
      "name": "RelayX",
      "url": "https://github.com/thothfnd/RelayX",
      "status": "Active development",
      "headline": "Communication without identity becoming the product.",
      "overview": "RelayX is not just a private messenger. Identity, contacts, messages and files are designed to remain under local control, without a phone number, email address or public profile. Communication is built around Tor-only networking, end-to-end encryption and a blind relay that handles temporary opaque packets. The goal is to reduce metadata and correlation surfaces without sacrificing the fluidity expected from a modern messenger.",
